% backend: none
% expect-output: true
% expect-output: integertype
% expect-output: integertype
% Scenario: time moves forward. usertime read before and after a loop
% never decreases; realtime and usertime are integers. Neither value is
% printed, since the rates and origins are the interpreter's own.
usertime 1000 { 0 pop } repeat usertime exch sub 0 ge =
realtime type ==
usertime type ==
